        <mxCell id="n_prule" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;PrometheusRule (monitoring.coreos.com)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Labels: release: kube-prometheus&lt;br&gt;• ServiceDown • HighErrorRate (5xx &amp;gt; 5%)&lt;br&gt;• HighLatency (P95 &amp;gt; 1s) • HighHeapUsage (&amp;gt; 75%)&lt;br&gt;• RedisExporterDown" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEE2E2;strokeColor=#EF4444;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#7F1D1D;fontSize=11;" vertex="1">
